(The ledger's time leaves, batch A - docs/ledger/time.md rows TIM-01,
 TIM-02, TIM-03, TIM-05, TIM-06, TIM-07, TIM-08, TIM-09, TIM-10, TIM-11,
 TIM-13, TIM-15, TIM-16, TIM-17, TIM-18, TIM-19, TIM-22, TIM-23, TIM-24,
 TIM-25, TIM-26, TIM-27, TIM-31, TIM-33, TIM-34, TIM-35, TIM-36, TIM-37,
 TIM-38, TIM-49.

 Each leaf is called directly off a pinned rng seed and its emitted
 source printed in full, so the golden is the generated Vox itself, the
 same convention tests/300 uses for the buffer leaves. This also pins
 down the fix for the bug the campaign caught in this batch: seed 834
 below is the exact seed that first surfaced two independent random
 draws deciding the same "seconds or milliseconds" choice - the
 assertion built from one draw, the statement rendered from the other -
 so a compiled 94ms `Wait` printed `Wait 0 seconds.` and asserted
 "expected at least 21". A single `'seconds flavor'` boolean, drawn once
 and threaded through, is what this golden now shows staying consistent
 between the rendered statement and the assertion's own bound.

 'gen leaf current time shape' is emitted nested and unnested, the same
 two ways 'gen join lines' can render a line; 'gen leaf timer duration
 and running' is emitted at three seeds to show the creation-form,
 verb-spelling, and wait-flavour variance without depending on any one
 of them landing in a single sample.)

Print "--- TIM-01, TIM-02, TIM-03, TIM-05..TIM-11, TIM-13: current time shape ---".
'rng seed' of 5.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf current time shape' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, nested ---".
'rng seed' of 5.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf current time shape' of "  " and true.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- TIM-22, TIM-23, TIM-24..TIM-27, TIM-31, TIM-33..TIM-38: timer lifecycle, bare creation, milliseconds wait ---".
'rng seed' of 7.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf timer duration and running' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, seed 12: Create form, seconds-flavour wait ---".
'rng seed' of 12.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf timer duration and running' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, seed 834: the wait-flavour bug's own repro seed ---".
'rng seed' of 834.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf timer duration and running' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.
